\[
\frac{M_{Bi}}{D_{Bi}}
\propto
\left(\frac{\lambda_i}{1-\lambda_i}\right)^{\frac{1}{1+\rho_i}}
\left(\frac{P_i^d}{P_B^{im}}\right)^{\frac{1}{1+\rho_i}}
\]
因此更严格地说，正确结果应是：
\[
M_{Bi}
=
D_{Bi}
\left[
\frac{P_i^d}{P_B^{im}}
\cdot
\frac{\lambda_i}{1-\lambda_i}
\right]^{\frac{1}{1+\rho_i}}
\]

